  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Application Scope**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the application\'s scope for the LPCS associates platform. The task requires a full-stack web application, and I\'m analyzing the existing environment, which is a Vite + React SPA + Express server template. This is a solid starting point! Next, I will begin to breakdown the functional requirements and technical requirements for the user to be able to accomplish all of their requests, in detail.\n\n\n**Revising Scope and Tech Stack**\n\nI\'ve hit a significant adjustment. The initial scope definition needs a major revision! The request specifies Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, PostgreSQL with Drizzle ORM, and Portuguese language support for LPCS associates. My primary focus is on adapting the previous plan to this new technical direction. I\'ll need to assess the implications for the technology stack. Cloud SQL is the focus, as the user requests PostgreSQL.\n\n\n"
