  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Design Principles**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the design principles, specifically the frontend. I\'ve noted the red theme (#dc2626), the red ribbon representing AIDS awareness, and the desired qualities: modern, clean, warm, solid, civic, institutional presence, and high polish. The entire presentation is in Portuguese of Portugal (pt-PT).\n\n\n**Analyzing System Features**\n\nI\'ve been analyzing the system features. I am now working through the \"Portal do Associado\" functionality. I\'ve noted the quota options and expiry status indicators. I am focused on partner discounts, and the anti-abuse system with the rotating 6-digit code. The protected receipts route is also under scrutiny. Finally, the dynamic home page hero calculation and the admin backoffice conditions are in focus.\n\n\n**Defining Database Structure**\n\nI\'m now deep in thought about the database. I\'ve chosen `better-sqlite3` for its speed, simplicity, and reliability, especially with file-based persistence for `lpcs.db`. I\'m outlining the schema, specifically focusing on tables for `users`, `sessions`, `quotas`, and `receipts`, ensuring all the necessary fields are included for each.\n\n\n**Expanding Database Schema**\n\nI\'m expanding the database schema, focusing on partner and redemption tables. Key fields I\'m including are `name`, `category`, `benefit_type`, `benefit_value`, and various status indicators. The `audit_logs` table seems crucial for tracking system activity. I\'ve also identified the essential fields, such as timestamps and user IDs.\n\n\\n\\n\n\nI\'ve also verified the Portuguese NIF and phone number validation algorithms. The NIF (tax ID) check includes the standard Module 11 checksum calculation. I\'m satisfied that these checks are accurate and reliable.\n\n\n**Validating System Inputs**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in validating system inputs. I\'ve formulated regular expressions for postal code validation and confirmed the age requirement (16+). I\'m also reviewing the member number generation format, `LPCS-` followed by five digits, and how password hashing with `scrypt` will be implemented. I\'ve rechecked the rotating 6-digit code generation, specifically HMAC-SHA256, and its time-step derivation to mitigate clock drift. The receipt storage and security protocols are next, specifically file type validation (PDF, PNG, JPG, WEBP) and size limits (5MB max), along with access control for downloads. Finally, I\'ve begun verifying the partners\' data, confirming the initial prompt.\n\n\n**Cataloging Partner Benefits**\n\nI\'m now cataloging partner benefits, specifically capturing the details for each entry. I\'m focusing on the type (coupon, code, voucher), the value, the specific offerings (e.g., discounts, free consultations, free items) and associated savings. I\'m also noting the partner details.\n\n\n**Compiling Partner Data**\n\nI\'m currently compiling and organizing the partner data. I am adding each entry, and noting the specific details of the benefits. I\'m noting the business name, category, location, and the specifics of the offer: coupon, code, or voucher, value, and potential savings.\n\n\n**Listing Partner Entries**\n\nI\'m now documenting partner entries and their corresponding benefits. I am recording each partner\'s offering, including coupons, codes, or vouchers, along with the monetary value and potential savings. I have also noted the specific details, such as the business\'s name, category, location, and the specifics of the offer.\n\n\n**Calculating Potential Savings**\n\nI\'m now calculating potential savings based on partner entries. I see that with some estimations and dynamic aggregations, we\'re looking at significant returns. Total annual savings could be around 1,500\342\202\254 or more, offering a multiplier exceeding 40x the quota. Individual partners offer enough value to cover the full quota. I\'ve also checked the application architecture.\n\n\n**Defining API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the API endpoints and have just outlined the `/api/auth/register`, `/api/auth/login`, and `/api/auth/logout` routes, defining their functionality and expected behavior. I am also working on endpoints for user profiles, quotas, and receipts, while ensuring authenticated access control and input validation. The `rate limit (max 5 / hour)` applies.\n\n\n**Defining API Functionality**\n\nI\'m now focusing on API functionality. I\'ve outlined several critical endpoints: `/api/partners/hero-stats` for dynamic savings calculations, `/api/benefits/redeem` for generating redemption codes, and `/api/benefits/verify-code` for merchant validation. I\'m also planning `/api/admin/*` routes for admin metrics, user management, and audit logs. I\'m connecting the frontend with a lightweight client router.\n\n\n**Designing Frontend Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on specific frontend design elements. I\'m prioritizing the layout: links, user greeting, quota status, and the admin link. I\'m emphasizing a beautiful, institutional design using Tailwind CSS v4 and the LPCS red accents. Pages are comprehensive: Home includes dynamic savings, benefit comparisons, and social cause calls. Partner pages feature a catalog with filters, partner cards, and member-only redemption options. I have begun work on the security.\n\n\n**Defining Frontend Elements**\n\nI\'m now detailing the frontend elements, specifically the rotating code modal and merchant validation process. I\'m focusing on the 6-digit rotating code with its countdown, anti-screenshot measures like watermarks and blurring, and merchant validation via a `/validar` form, providing instant verification with associate details. The dashboard is coming together with quota status, renewal simulations, and recent payments. I\'m also planning the payments section with summary stats, simulation forms, and receipt uploads. The profile section is also starting to take form.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1950726299936947483"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import Database from \'better-sqlite3\';\\nimport path from \'path\';\\nimport crypto from \'crypto\';\\n\\nconst dbPath = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \'lpcs.db\');\\nexport const db = new Database(dbPath);\\n\\n// Enable WAL mode for better concurrency and performance\\ndb.pragma(\'journal_mode = WAL\');\\n\\n// Initialize database schema\\nexport function initDb() {\\n  db.exec(`\\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (\\n      id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\\n      email TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n      password_hash TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      salt TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      name TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      birth_date TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      address TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      postal_code TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      city TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      nif TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n      phone TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      member_number TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n      is_admin INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n      is_suspended INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n      google_id TEXT,\\n      created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime(\'now\')),\\n      updated_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime(\'now\'))\\n    );\\n\\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS sessions (\\n      id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\\n      user_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n      token TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n      expires_at TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime(\'now\'))\\n    );\\n\\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS quotas (\\n      id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\\n      user_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n      plan_type TEXT NOT NULL, -- \'semestral\' | \'anual\'\\n      amount_cents INTEGER NOT NULL,\\n      payment_method TEXT NOT NULL, -- \'mbway\' | \'multibanco\' | \'card\' | \'transferencia\' | \'manual\'\\n      reference TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT \'pago\', -- \'pago\' | \'pendente\' | \'cancelado\'\\n      valid_from TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      valid_until TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime(\'now\'))\\n    );\\n\\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS receipts (\\n      id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\\n      user_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n      quota_id INTEGER REFERENCES quotas(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n      original_name TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      mime_type TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      file_size INTEGER NOT NULL,\\n      file_base64 TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      notes TEXT,\\n      created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime(\'now\'))\\n    );\\n\\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS partners (\\n      id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\\n      name TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      category TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      description TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      area TEXT NOT NULL, -- Sa\303\272de e Bem-estar, Desporto, Lazer e Cultura, Restaura\303\247\303\243o e Alimenta\303\247\303\243o, Forma\303\247\303\243o e Educa\303\247\303\243o, Servi\303\247os\\n      district TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      city TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      benefit_type TEXT NOT NULL, -- \'cupao\' | \'codigo\' | \'voucher\'\\n      benefit_value TEXT NOT NULL, -- e.g. \\\"5\342\202\254 por compra (\303\2276)\\\", \\\"25% em an\303\241lises\\\"\\n      discount_highlight TEXT NOT NULL, -- e.g. \\\"25% de desconto\\\", \\\"50\342\202\254 em tratamentos\\\"\\n      usage_limit TEXT NOT NULL, -- e.g. \\\"At\303\251 6 utiliza\303\247\303\265es por s\303\263cio\\\", \\\"Utiliza\303\247\303\243o cont\303\255nua\\\"\\n      estimated_annual_savings REAL NOT NULL DEFAULT 50.0,\\n      valid_until TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT \'2027-12-31\',\\n      terms TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      website TEXT,\\n      is_active INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,\\n      secret_code TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime(\'now\'))\\n    );\\n\\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS redemptions (\\n      id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\\n      partner_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES partners(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n      user_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n      secret_salt TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      reference_code TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n      issued_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime(\'now\')),\\n      expires_at TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT \'active\', -- \'active\' | \'used\' | \'expired\'\\n      used_at TEXT,\\n      used_by_merchant TEXT\\n    );\\n\\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS audit_logs (\\n      id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\\n      user_id INTEGER REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n      action TEXT NOT NULL, -- \'emissao_codigo\' | \'visualizacao_codigo\' | \'validacao_sucesso\' | \'validacao_falha\' | \'quota_paga\' | \'perfil_atualizado\'\\n      details TEXT NOT NULL,\\n      ip_address TEXT,\\n      user_agent TEXT,\\n      created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime(\'now\'))\\n    );\\n\\n    CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_sessions_token ON sessions(token);\\n    CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_quotas_user ON quotas(user_id);\\n    CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_receipts_user ON receipts(user_id);\\n    CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_redemptions_ref ON redemptions(reference_code);\\n    CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_redemptions_user ON redemptions(user_id, partner_id);\\n  `);\\n\\n  seedData();\\n}\\n\\n// Scrypt password hashing helper\\nexport function hashPassword(password: string): { hash: string; salt: string } {\\n  const salt = crypto.randomBytes(16).toString(\'hex\');\\n  const hash = crypto.scryptSync(password, salt, 64).toString(\'hex\');\\n  return { hash, salt };\\n}\\n\\nexport function verifyPassword(password: string, hash: string, salt: string): boolean {\\n  const derived = crypto.scryptSync(password, salt, 64).toString(\'hex\');\\n  return crypto.timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(derived, \'hex\'), Buffer.from(hash, \'hex\'));\\n}\\n\\nfunction seedData() {\\n  // Check if admin already exists\\n  const adminCheck = db.prepare(\'SELECT id FROM users WHERE email = ?\').get(\'admin@lpcs.pt\');\\n  if (!adminCheck) {\\n    const adminPass = hashPassword(\'Admin!2026\');\\n    db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO users (\\n        email, password_hash, salt, name, birth_date, address, postal_code,\\n        city, nif, phone, member_number, is_admin, is_suspended\\n      ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, 1, 0)\\n    `).run(\\n      \'admin@lpcs.pt\',\\n      adminPass.hash,\\n      adminPass.salt,\\n      \'Administrador LPCS\',\\n      \'1980-05-15\',\\n      \'Rua de Santa Maria Maior, 42\',\\n      \'1100-001\',\\n      \'Lisboa\',\\n      \'123456789\', // Special admin seed NIF\\n      \'912345678\',\\n      \'LPCS-00001\'\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  // Check if demo member exists\\n  const demoCheck = db.prepare(\'SELECT id FROM users WHERE email = ?\').get(\'demo@lpcs.pt\');\\n  let demoUserId: number;\\n  if (!demoCheck) {\\n    const demoPass = hashPassword(\'demo1234\');\\n    const result = db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO users (\\n        email, password_hash, salt, name, birth_date, address, postal_code,\\n        city, nif, phone, member_number, is_admin, is_suspended\\n      ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, 0, 0)\\n    `).run(\\n      \'demo@lpcs.pt\',\\n      demoPass.hash,\\n      demoPass.salt,\\n      \'Ana Maria Silva Ferreira\',\\n      \'1992-04-18\',\\n      \'Avenida da Liberdade, 120, 3\302\272 Dto\',\\n      \'1250-142\',\\n      \'Lisboa\',\\n      \'234567890\',\\n      \'961234567\',\\n      \'LPCS-10842\'\\n    );\\n    demoUserId = Number(result.lastInsertRowid);\\n\\n    // Seed 1 expired semestral quota (from 18 months ago to 12 months ago)\\n    const pastStart = new Date(Date.now() - 540 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n    const pastEnd = new Date(Date.now() - 360 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n    db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO quotas (\\n        user_id, plan_type, amount_cents, payment_method, reference, status, valid_from, valid_until\\n      ) VALUES (?, \'semestral\', 1750, \'multibanco\', \'21876-948102847\', \'pago\', ?, ?)\\n    `).run(demoUserId, pastStart, pastEnd);\\n\\n    // Seed 1 active annual quota valid until next year\\n    const nowStart = new Date().toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n    const activeEnd = new Date(Date.now() + 320 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n    const quotaRes = db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO quotas (\\n        user_id, plan_type, amount_cents, payment_method, reference, status, valid_from, valid_until\\n      ) VALUES (?, \'anual\', 3500, \'mbway\', \'MBWAY-961234567\', \'pago\', ?, ?)\\n    `).run(demoUserId, nowStart, activeEnd);\\n\\n    const quotaId = Number(quotaRes.lastInsertRowid);\\n\\n    // Seed 1 archived sample receipt for demo user\\n    const sampleReceiptBase64 = Buffer.from(\\n      `LIGA PORTUGUESA CONTRA A SIDA\\\\nRecibo de Quota Anual 2026\\\\nS\303\263cio: Ana Maria Silva Ferreira (LPCS-10842)\\\\nNIF: 234567890\\\\nValor: 35.00 EUR (Isento de IVA art. 9\302\272 CIVA)\\\\nData: ${nowStart}\\\\nObrigado pelo seu apoio \303\240 nossa causa!`\\n    ).toString(\'base64\');\\n\\n    db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO receipts (\\n        user_id, quota_id, original_name, mime_type, file_size, file_base64, notes\\n      ) VALUES (?, ?, \'Recibo_Quota_LPCS_2026.pdf\', \'application/pdf\', 2048, ?, \'Recibo oficial da quota anual de 35,00\342\202\254\')\\n    `).run(demoUserId, quotaId, sampleReceiptBase64);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Seed the 28 partners specified in requirements\\n  const partnersCount = db.prepare(\'SELECT count(*) as count FROM partners\').get() as { count: number };\\n  if (partnersCount.count < 28) {\\n    db.prepare(\'DELETE FROM partners\').run();\\n\\n    const initialPartners = [\\n      {\\n        name: \'Farm\303\241cia Sa\303\272de+\',\\n        category: \'Farm\303\241cias & Parafarm\303\241cia\',\\n        area: \'Sa\303\272de e Bem-estar\',\\n        district: \'Lisboa\',\\n        city: \'Lisboa\',\\n        benefit_type: \'cupao\',\\n        benefit_value: \'5\342\202\254 por compra (\303\2276)\',\\n        discount_highlight: \'5\342\202\254 de desconto por compra\',\\n        usage_limit: \'Cup\303\243o de 5,00\342\202\254 \302\267 at\303\251 6 utiliza\303\247\303\265es por ano\',\\n        estimated_annual_savings: 30.0,\\n        secret_code: \'FARMA5\',\\n        terms: \'V\303\241lido em compras superiores a 25\342\202\254 em produtos de sa\303\272de e bem-estar. N\303\243o acumul\303\241vel com outras campanhas.\',\\n        description: \'Rede de farm\303\241cias com aconselhamento farmac\303\252utico dedicado, dermocosm\303\251tica e testes r\303\241pidos preventivos.\'\\n      },\\n      {\\n        name: \'Cl\303\255nica Vida Lab\',\\n        category: \'An\303\241lises Cl\303\255nicas\',\\n        area: \'Sa\303\272de e Bem-estar\',\\n        district: \'Lisboa\',\\n        city: \'Lisboa\',\\n        benefit_type: \'codigo\',\\n        benefit_value: \'25% em an\303\241lises\',\\n        discount_highlight: \'25% de desconto em an\303\241lises\',\\n        usage_limit: \'C\303\263digo de desconto \302\267 Utiliza\303\247\303\243o cont\303\255nua\',\\n        estimated_annual_savings: 45.0,\\n        secret_code: \'VIDA25\',\\n        terms: \'Aplic\303\241vel a todas as an\303\241lises cl\303\255nicas gerais e rastreios de infe\303\247\303\265es sexualmente transmiss\303\255veis.\',\\n        description: \'Laborat\303\263rio de an\303\241lises cl\303\255nicas moderno e discreto com resultados r\303\241pidos online e atendimento humanizado.\'\\n      },\\n      {\\n        name: \'Centro Diagn\303\263stico Norte\',\\n        category: \'Diagn\303\263stico & Imagiologia\',\\n        area: \'Sa\303\272de e Bem-estar\',\\n        district: \'Porto\',\\n        city: \'Porto\',\\n        benefit_type: \'voucher\',\\n        benefit_value: \'1 exame gratuito\',\\n        discount_highlight: \'1 exame gratuito\',\\n        usage_limit: \'Voucher nominal \302\267 Uso \303\272nico por associado\',\\n        es