  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the API Router**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the API router in `/src/server/api.ts`. I\'ve outlined the first endpoint, a POST request to `/api/auth/register` for native authentication forms. It will expect fields such as name, email, password, birth\\_date, address, postal\\_code, city, nif, and phone.\n\n\n**Refining Input Validation**\n\nI\'m currently refining the server-side input validation for the registration endpoint. I\'ve defined rules for fields like name (minimum two words), birth date (minimum age), and specific formats for postal codes, NIFs, and phone numbers. I\'ll also enforce email and NIF uniqueness. Error handling varies by request type; HTML form submissions redirect, while JSON requests return error objects. On success, I plan to hash the password and generate a member number.\n\n\n**Defining New API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining additional API endpoints for authentication, profile management, and quota handling. Specifically, I\'m working on the logout functionality (`POST /api/auth/logout`), the \"me\" endpoint (`GET /api/auth/me`), and the profile retrieval and update endpoints. I\'m also planning the quota payment endpoint (`POST /api/quotas/pay`), determining its structure to accommodate plan types and payment methods with logic for updating existing quotas.\n\n\n**Implementing Receipt Features**\n\nI\'ve just added several API endpoints. A new receipt generation happens automatically with quota records. I\'m also implementing the receipt history retrieval via `GET /api/quotas/history`. Now, I\'m working on uploading receipts with `POST /api/receipts/upload`, using Multer for file handling, and defining content types and sizes. I\'m also adding `GET /api/receipts/:id` and `DELETE /api/receipts/:id` with authentication and ownership/admin checks.\nI\'ve also introduced a public `/api/partners` endpoint to display all partners and discounts, concealing secret discount codes unless the user has an active quota.\n\n\n**Developing Benefit Redemption**\n\nI\'m now implementing the benefit redemption feature using `POST /api/benefits/redeem`. I\'m focusing on user authentication and active quota checks, along with rate limits (5 issuances per hour) and preventing duplicate active redemptions. The endpoint generates unique reference codes and TOTP codes for each redemption, with an expiration time. I\'m also planning to log audit events, for which I\'m adding an endpoint for code refreshing at `GET /api/benefits/code-refresh/:redemptionId`.\n\n\n**Finalizing Code Verification**\n\nI\'m now implementing the merchant validation endpoint, `/api/benefits/verify-code`, to complete the benefit redemption flow. This includes verifying the reference and 6-digit codes against active redemptions, considering a 30-second window. Upon successful verification, I\'ll mark the redemption as \'used\', log audit events, and return relevant information to the merchant. I\'ve also moved to implement the admin access features.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8231273886260444009"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Router, Request, Response } from \'express\';\\nimport multer from \'multer\';\\nimport crypto from \'crypto\';\\nimport { db, hashPassword, verifyPassword } from \'./db.ts\';\\nimport {\\n  getSessionUser,\\n  createSession,\\n  clearSession,\\n  isUserAdmin,\\n  validateNif,\\n  validatePortuguesePhone,\\n  validatePostalCode,\\n  validateAge,\\n  generateMemberNumber,\\n  getQuotaStatus,\\n} from \'./auth.ts\';\\nimport {\\n  generateTOTPCode,\\n  verifyTOTPCode,\\n  checkIssuanceRateLimit,\\n  logAudit,\\n} from \'./totp.ts\';\\n\\nconst router = Router();\\n\\n// Configure multer for memory storage (max 5MB)\\nconst upload = multer({\\n  storage: multer.memoryStorage(),\\n  limits: { fileSize: 5 * 1024 * 1024 },\\n  fileFilter: (_req, file, cb) => {\\n    const allowed = [\'application/pdf\', \'image/png\', \'image/jpeg\', \'image/webp\'];\\n    if (allowed.includes(file.mimetype)) {\\n      cb(null, true);\\n    } else {\\n      cb(new Error(\'Formato n\303\243o suportado. Por favor envie PDF, PNG, JPG ou WEBP.\'));\\n    }\\n  },\\n});\\n\\n// Helper for native forms redirect or JSON response\\nfunction handleResponse(\\n  req: Request,\\n  res: Response,\\n  successRedirect: string,\\n  errorRedirect: string,\\n  data: any,\\n  error?: string\\n) {\\n  const isHtml = req.headers.accept?.includes(\'text/html\') && !req.xhr;\\n  if (error) {\\n    if (isHtml) {\\n      const url = `${errorRedirect}${errorRedirect.includes(\'?\') ? \'&\' : \'?\'}error=${encodeURIComponent(error)}`;\\n      return res.redirect(url);\\n    }\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error });\\n  }\\n\\n  if (isHtml) {\\n    return res.redirect(successRedirect);\\n  }\\n  return res.json(data);\\n}\\n\\n// ==========================================\\n// 1. AUTHENTICATION (Native Forms + Route Handlers)\\n// ==========================================\\n\\n// Register\\nrouter.post(\'/auth/register\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const {\\n    name,\\n    email,\\n    password,\\n    birth_date,\\n    address,\\n    postal_code,\\n    city,\\n    nif,\\n    phone,\\n  } = req.body;\\n\\n  // Validation\\n  if (!name || name.trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length < 2) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'O nome deve conter pelo menos dois termos (ex: Nome e Apelido).\');\\n  }\\n  if (!email || !/^[^\\\\s@]+@[^\\\\s@]+\\\\.[^\\\\s@]+$/.test(email.trim())) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'Por favor introduza um endere\303\247o de e-mail v\303\241lido.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!password || password.length < 6) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'A palavra-passe deve ter pelo menos 6 caracteres.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!birth_date || !validateAge(birth_date)) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'Deve ter pelo menos 16 anos para se registar como associado.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!address || address.trim().length < 5) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'Por favor indique a morada completa.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!postal_code || !validatePostalCode(postal_code)) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'O c\303\263digo postal deve ter o formato portugu\303\252s 0000-000.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!city || city.trim().length < 2) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'Por favor indique a localidade.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!nif || !validateNif(nif)) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'NIF inv\303\241lido. Verifique o n\303\272mero e o d\303\255gito de controlo.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!phone || !validatePortuguesePhone(phone)) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'O telem\303\263vel deve ser portugu\303\252s (9 d\303\255gitos come\303\247ado por 91, 92, 93 ou 96).\');\\n  }\\n\\n  // Check unique email and NIF\\n  const existingEmail = db.prepare(\'SELECT id FROM users WHERE email = ?\').get(email.trim().toLowerCase());\\n  if (existingEmail) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'J\303\241 existe uma conta associada a este e-mail. Inicie sess\303\243o.\');\\n  }\\n  const existingNif = db.prepare(\'SELECT id FROM users WHERE nif = ?\').get(nif.trim());\\n  if (existingNif) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'J\303\241 existe um associado registado com este NIF.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  const { hash, salt } = hashPassword(password);\\n  const memberNumber = generateMemberNumber();\\n\\n  try {\\n    const result = db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO users (\\n        name, email, password_hash, salt, birth_date, address, postal_code,\\n        city, nif, phone, member_number, is_admin, is_suspended\\n      ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, 0, 0)\\n    `).run(\\n      name.trim(),\\n      email.trim().toLowerCase(),\\n      hash,\\n      salt,\\n      birth_date,\\n      address.trim(),\\n      postal_code.trim(),\\n      city.trim(),\\n      nif.trim(),\\n      phone.trim(),\\n      memberNumber\\n    );\\n\\n    const userId = Number(result.lastInsertRowid);\\n    createSession(userId, res);\\n\\n    logAudit(userId, \'registo_s\303\263cio\', `Novo associado registado: ${memberNumber}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', {\\n      success: true,\\n      memberNumber,\\n      redirect: \'/dashboard\',\\n    });\\n  } catch (err: any) {\\n    console.error(\'Registration error:\', err);\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/registar\', null, \'Ocorreu um erro ao registar o associado. Tente novamente.\');\\n  }\\n});\\n\\n// Login\\nrouter.post(\'/auth/login\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const { email, password } = req.body;\\n  if (!email || !password) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/entrar\', null, \'Por favor preencha o e-mail e a palavra-passe.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  const user = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?\').get(email.trim().toLowerCase()) as any;\\n  if (!user) {\\n    logAudit(null, \'login_falhado\', `Tentativa para email inexistente: ${email}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/entrar\', null, \'E-mail ou palavra-passe incorretos.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  if (user.is_suspended) {\\n    logAudit(user.id, \'login_bloqueado\', `Tentativa de login em conta suspensa: ${email}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/entrar\', null, \'A sua conta de associado encontra-se suspensa. Contacte a LPCS.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  const isValid = verifyPassword(password, user.password_hash, user.salt);\\n  if (!isValid) {\\n    logAudit(user.id, \'login_falhado\', `Palavra-passe errada para: ${email}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/dashboard\', \'/entrar\', null, \'E-mail ou palavra-passe incorretos.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  createSession(user.id, res);\\n  logAudit(user.id, \'login_sucesso\', `Login efetuado com sucesso`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n\\n  const target = user.is_admin === 1 ? \'/admin\' : \'/dashboard\';\\n  return handleResponse(req, res, target, \'/entrar\', {\\n    success: true,\\n    redirect: target,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Logout\\nrouter.post(\'/auth/logout\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (user) {\\n    logAudit(user.id, \'logout\', \'Sess\303\243o terminada\', req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n  }\\n  clearSession(req, res);\\n  return handleResponse(req, res, \'/\', \'/\', { success: true, redirect: \'/\' });\\n});\\n\\n// Current user details\\nrouter.get(\'/auth/me\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.json({ user: null });\\n  }\\n  return res.json({\\n    user,\\n    isAdmin: isUserAdmin(user),\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// ==========================================\\n// 2. PROFILE MANAGEMENT\\n// ==========================================\\n\\nrouter.get(\'/profile\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(401).json({ error: \'N\303\243o autenticado\' });\\n  }\\n  return res.json({ profile: user });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.post(\'/profile\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'Sess\303\243o expirada. Por favor inicie sess\303\243o.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  const { name, birth_date, address, postal_code, city, nif, phone } = req.body;\\n\\n  if (!name || name.trim().split(/\\\\s+/).length < 2) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'O nome deve conter pelo menos dois termos.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!birth_date || !validateAge(birth_date)) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'A idade m\303\255nima \303\251 de 16 anos.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!address || address.trim().length < 5) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'Indique a morada completa.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!postal_code || !validatePostalCode(postal_code)) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'C\303\263digo postal inv\303\241lido. Use 0000-000.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!city || city.trim().length < 2) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'Indique a localidade.\');\\n  }\\n  if (!nif || !validateNif(nif)) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'NIF inv\303\241lido (verifique o d\303\255gito de controlo).\');\\n  }\\n  if (!phone || !validatePortuguesePhone(phone)) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'Telem\303\263vel deve ser portugu\303\252s (9 d\303\255gitos, 91/92/93/96).\');\\n  }\\n\\n  // Check NIF uniqueness if changed\\n  const existingNif = db.prepare(\'SELECT id FROM users WHERE nif = ? AND id != ?\').get(nif.trim(), user.id);\\n  if (existingNif) {\\n    return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil\', \'/perfil\', null, \'Este NIF j\303\241 pertence a outro associado.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  db.prepare(`\\n    UPDATE users SET\\n      name = ?, birth_date = ?, address = ?, postal_code = ?,\\n      city = ?, nif = ?, phone = ?, updated_at = datetime(\'now\')\\n    WHERE id = ?\\n  `).run(\\n    name.trim(),\\n    birth_date,\\n    address.trim(),\\n    postal_code.trim(),\\n    city.trim(),\\n    nif.trim(),\\n    phone.trim(),\\n    user.id\\n  );\\n\\n  logAudit(user.id, \'perfil_atualizado\', \'Dados pessoais atualizados\', req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n\\n  return handleResponse(req, res, \'/perfil?sucesso=1\', \'/perfil\', {\\n    success: true,\\n    message: \'Perfil atualizado com sucesso.\',\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// ==========================================\\n// 3. QUOTAS & PAYMENTS\\n// ==========================================\\n\\nrouter.post(\'/quotas/pay\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(401).json({ error: \'Inicie sess\303\243o para pagar a quota.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const { plan_type, payment_method, phone_mbway } = req.body;\\n  if (![\'semestral\', \'anual\'].includes(plan_type)) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'Plano inv\303\241lido. Escolha semestral ou anual.\' });\\n  }\\n  if (![\'mbway\', \'multibanco\', \'card\', \'transferencia\'].includes(payment_method)) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'M\303\251todo de pagamento inv\303\241lido.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const amountCents = plan_type === \'semestral\' ? 1750 : 3500;\\n  const monthsToAdd = plan_type === \'semestral\' ? 6 : 12;\\n\\n  // Calculate accumulated validity date!\\n  // Find current active quota validity\\n  const currentStatus = getQuotaStatus(user.id);\\n  let startDate: Date;\\n\\n  if (currentStatus.has_active_quota && currentStatus.valid_until) {\\n    // Accumulate on top of existing valid_until!\\n    startDate = new Date(currentStatus.valid_until + \'T00:00:00\');\\n  } else {\\n    // Starts from today\\n    startDate = new Date();\\n  }\\n\\n  const endDate = new Date(startDate);\\n  endDate.setMonth(endDate.getMonth() + monthsToAdd);\\n\\n  const validFromStr = startDate.toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n  const validUntilStr = endDate.toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n\\n  // Generate reference\\n  let reference = \'\';\\n  if (payment_method === \'mbway\') {\\n    reference = `MBWAY-${phone_mbway || user.phone}`;\\n  } else if (payment_method === \'multibanco\') {\\n    const ent = \'21876\';\\n    const ref = Math.floor(100000000 + Math.random() * 900000000);\\n    reference = `Ent: ${ent} | Ref: ${ref}`;\\n  } else if (payment_method === \'card\') {\\n    reference = `CARD-SIM-${Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 9).toUpperCase()}`;\\n  } else {\\n    reference = `TRANSF-LPCS-${Date.now().toString().slice(-6)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  const result = db.prepare(`\\n    INSERT INTO quotas (\\n      user_id, plan_type, amount_cents, payment_method, reference, status, valid_from, valid_until\\n    ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, \'pago\', ?, ?)\\n  `).run(\\n    user.id,\\n    plan_type,\\n    amountCents,\\n    payment_method,\\n    reference,\\n    validFromStr,\\n    validUntilStr\\n  );\\n\\n  const quotaId = Number(result.lastInsertRowid);\\n\\n  // Automatically generate official LPCS digital receipt\\n  const receiptText = `================================================\\nLIGA PORTUGUESA CONTRA A SIDA (LPCS)\\nPessoa Coletiva de Utilidade P\303\272blica\\nNIPC: 502 489 120\\n------------------------------------------------\\nRECIBO DE QUOTA N\302\272 LPCS-REC-${quotaId.toString().padStart(6, \'0\')}\\nData de Emiss\303\243o: ${new Date().toISOString().split(\'T\')[0]}\\n------------------------------------------------\\nDADOS DO ASSOCIADO:\\nNome: ${user.name}\\nN\302\272 de S\303\263cio: ${user.member_number}\\nNIF: ${user.nif}\\nMorada: ${user.address}, ${user.postal_code} ${user.city}\\n------------------------------------------------\\nDESCRI\303\207\303\203O:\\nQuota ${plan_type === \'semestral\' ? \'Semestral (6 Meses)\' : \'Anual (12 Meses)\'}\\nPer\303\255odo de Validade: ${validFromStr} at\303\251 ${validUntilStr}\\nM\303\251todo: ${payment_method.toUpperCase()} (${reference})\\nValor Total Pago: ${(amountCents / 100).toFixed(2)} EUR\\n(Isento de IVA ao abrigo do artigo 9.\302\272 do CIVA)\\n------------------------------------------------\\nObrigado pelo seu compromisso cont\303\255nuo na luta contra\\na SIDA, no apoio a quem vive com VIH e na promo\303\247\303\243o\\nda sa\303\272de e direitos humanos em Portugal.\\n================================================`;\\n\\n  const receiptBase64 = Buffer.from(receiptText).toString(\'base64\');\\n  db.prepare(`\\n    INSERT INTO receipts (\\n      user_id, quota_id, original_name, mime_type, file_size, file_base64, notes\\n    ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, \'text/plain\', ?, ?, ?)\\n  `).run(\\n    user.id,\\n    quotaId,\\n    `Recibo_Quota_${plan_type.toUpperCase()}_LPCS_${validUntilStr}.txt`,\\n    Buffer.byteLength(receiptText),\\n    receiptBase64,\\n    `Recibo emitido automaticamente para o pagamento da quota ${plan_type}`\\n  );\\n\\n  logAudit(\\n    user.id,\\n    \'quota_paga\',\\n    `Quota ${plan_type} de ${(amountCents / 100).toFixed(2)}\342\202\254 paga via ${payment_method}. Validade acumulada at\303\251 ${validUntilStr}`,\\n    req.ip,\\n    req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n  );\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    success: true,\\n    message: \'Pagamento processado com sucesso! A sua quota foi atualizada.\',\\n    valid_until: validUntilStr,\\n    quota_id: quotaId,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.get(\'/quotas/history\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(401).json({ error: \'N\303\243o autenticado\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const quotas = db.prepare(`\\n    SELECT * FROM quotas\\n    WHERE user_id = ?\\n    ORDER BY created_at DESC\\n  `).all(user.id);\\n\\n  const receipts = db.prepare(`\\n    SELECT id, quota_id, original_name, mime_type, file_size, notes, created_at\\n    FROM receipts\\n    WHERE user_id = ?\\n    ORDER BY created_at DESC\\n  `).all(user.id);\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    quotas,\\n    receipts,\\n    status: getQuotaStatus(user.id),\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// ==========================================\\n// 4. RECEIPTS MANAGEMENT (Protected Route)\\n// ==========================================\\n\\nrouter.post(\'/receipts/upload\', upload.single(\'receipt_file\'), (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(401).json({ error: \'Inicie sess\303\243o para enviar recibos.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!req.file) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'Nenhum ficheiro selecionado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const { quota_id, notes } = req.body;\\n  const fileBase64 = req.file.buffer.toString(\'base64\');\\n\\n  const result = db.prepare(`\\n    INSERT INTO receipts (\\n      user_id, quota_id, original_name, mime_type, file_size, file_base64, notes\\n    ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)\\n  `).run(\\n    user.id,\\n    quota_id ? Number(quota_id) : null,\\n    req.file.originalname,\\n    req.file.mimetype,\\n    req.file.size,\\n    fileBase64,\\n    notes || null\\n  );\\n\\n  logAudit(\\n    user.id,\\n    \'recibo_enviado\',\\n    `Ficheiro ${req.file.originalname} (${(req.file.size / 1024).toFixed(1)} KB) arquivado`,\\n    req.ip,\\n    req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n  );\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    success: true,\\n    message: \'Recibo arquivado com sucesso.\',\\n    receiptId: Number(result.lastInsertRowid),\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Secure download route checking session and ownership\\nrouter.get(\'/receipts/:id\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(401).send(\'Acesso n\303\243o autorizado. Por favor inicie sess\303\243o.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  const receipt = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM receipts WHERE id = ?\').get(req.params.id) as any;\\n  if (!receipt) {\\n    return res.status(404).send(\'Recibo n\303\243o encontrado.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  // Check ownership: must be the owner OR an administrator\\n  if (receipt.user_id !== user.id && !isUserAdmin(user)) {\\n    logAudit(user.id, \'acesso_negado_recibo\', `Tentativa de aceder ao recibo de outro associado: ID ${receipt.id}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return res.status(403).send(\'N\303\243o tem permiss\303\243o para aceder a este documento.\');\\n  }\\n\\n  const fileBuffer = Buffer.from(receipt.file_base64, \'base64\');\\n  res.setHeader(\'Content-Type\', receipt.mime_type);\\n  res.setHeader(\'Content-Disposition\', `inline; filename=\\\"${receipt.original_name}\\\"`);\\n  return res.send(fileBuffer);\\n});\\n\\nrouter.delete(\'/receipts/:id\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(401).json({ error: \'N\303\243o autenticado\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const receipt = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM receipts WHERE id = ?\').get(req.params.id) as any;\\n  if (!receipt) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Recibo n\303\243o encontrado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  if (receipt.user_id !== user.id && !isUserAdmin(user)) {\\n    return res.status(403).json({ error: \'Permiss\303\243o negada.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  db.prepare(\'DELETE FROM receipts WHERE id = ?\').run(req.params.id);\\n  logAudit(user.id, \'recibo_removido\', `Recibo ${receipt.original_name} removido`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n\\n  return res.json({ success: true, message: \'Recibo removido com sucesso.\' });\\n});\\n\\n// ==========================================\\n// 5. PARTNERS & DYNAMIC HOMEPAGE STATS (Public with Server Masking)\\n// ==========================================\\n\\nrouter.get(\'/partners\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  const hasActiveQuota = user?.quota_status?.has_active_quota || false;\\n\\n  const { area, district, city, benefit_type, search } = req.query;\\n\\n  let query = \'SELECT * FROM partners WHERE is_active = 1\';\\n  const params: any[] = [];\\n\\n  if (area && typeof area === \'string\' && area !== \'all\') {\\n    query += \' AND area = ?\';\\n    params.push(area);\\n  }\\n  if (district && typeof district === \'string\' && district !== \'all\') {\\n    query += \' AND district = ?\';\\n    params.push(district);\\n  }\\n  if (city && typeof city === \'string\' && city !== \'all\') {\\n    query += \' AND city = ?\';\\n    params.push(city);\\n  }\\n  if (benefit_type && typeof benefit_type === \'string\' && benefit_type !== \'all\') {\\n    query += \' AND benefit_type = ?\';\\n    params.push(benefit_type);\\n  }\\n  if (search && typeof search === \'string\' && search.trim() !== \'\') {\\n    query += \' AND (name LIKE ? OR description LIKE ? OR discount_highlight LIKE ? OR category LIKE ?)\';\\n    const term = `%${search.trim()}%`;\\n    params.push(term, term, term, term);\\n  }\\n\\n  query += \' ORDER BY name ASC\';\\n\\n  const rows = db.prepare(query).all(...params) as any[];\\n\\n  // Mask secret_code on the server if user does not have active quota!\\n  const sanitized = rows.map((p) => {\\n    return {\\n      id: p.id,\\n      name: p.name,\\n      category: p.category,\\n      description: p.description,\\n      area: p.area,\\n      district: p.district,\\n      city: p.city,\\n      benefit_type: p.benefit_type,\\n      benefit_value: p.benefit_value,\\n      discount_highlight: p.discount_highlight,\\n      usage_limit: p.usage_limit,\\n      estimated_annual_savings: p.estimated_annual_savings,\\n      valid_until: p.valid_until,\\n      terms: p.terms,\\n      website: p.website,\\n      // Only reveal secret_code to members with active quota\\n      secret_code: hasActiveQuota ? p.secret_code : null,\\n      can_access_code: hasActiveQuota,\\n    };\\n  });\\n\\n  // Calculate distinct filter options and area counts\\n  const allActive = db.prepare(\'SELECT area, district, city FROM partners WHERE is_active = 1\').all() as any[];\\n  const areaCounts: Record<string, number> = {};\\n  const districtsSet = new Set<string>();\\n  const citiesByDistrict: Record<string, Set<string>> = {};\\n\\n  for (const item of allActive) {\\n    areaCounts[item.area] = (areaCounts[item.area] || 0) + 1;\\n    districtsSet.add(item.district);\\n    if (!citiesByDistrict[item.district]) {\\n      citiesByDistrict[item.district] = new Set();\\n    }\\n    citiesByDistrict[item.district].add(item.city);\\n  }\\n\\n  const citiesFormatted: Record<string, string[]> = {};\\n  for (const [dist, set] of Object.entries(citiesByDistrict)) {\\n    citiesFormatted[dist] = Array.from(set).sort();\\n  }\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    partners: sanitized,\\n    totalCount: sanitized.length,\\n    userHasQuota: hasActiveQuota,\\n    filterMeta: {\\n      areaCounts,\\n      districts: Array.from(districtsSet).sort(),\\n      citiesByDistrict: citiesFormatted,\\n    },\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Dynamic Hero statistics calculated strictly from the database\\nrouter.get(\'/partners/hero-stats\', (_req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const activePartners = db.prepare(`\\n    SELECT id, name, area, benefit_type, estimated_annual_savings, discount_highlight\\n    FROM partners\\n    WHERE is_active = 1\\n  `).all() as Array<{\\n    id: number;\\n    name: string;\\n    area: string;\\n    benefit_type: string;\\n    estimated_annual_savings: number;\\n    discount_highlight: string;\\n  }>;\\n\\n  const totalSavings = activePartners.reduce((acc, p) => acc + (p.estimated_annual_savings || 0), 0);\\n  const quotaAnnual = 35.0;\\n  const savingsMultiplier = Math.round((totalSavings / quotaAnnual) * 10) / 10;\\n\\n  // Count partners that alone pay off the 35\342\202\254 quota\\n  const partnersPayingQuota = activePartners.filter((p) => p.estimated_annual_savings >= quotaAnnual);\\n\\n  // Breakdown by benefit type\\n  const couponSavings = activePartners\\n    .filter((p) => p.benefit_type === \'cupao\')\\n    .reduce((acc, p) => acc + p.estimated_annual_savings, 0);\\n  const voucherSavings = activePartners\\n    .filter((p) => p.benefit_type === \'voucher\')\\n    .reduce((acc, p) => acc + p.estimated_annual_savings, 0);\\n  const codeSavings = activePartners\\n    .filter((p) => p.benefit_type === \'codigo\')\\n    .reduce((acc, p) => acc + p.estimated_annual_savings, 0);\\n\\n  // Top 4 benefits\\n  const topBenefits = [...activePartners]\\n    .sort((a, b) => b.estimated_annual_savings - a.estimated_annual_savings)\\n    .slice(0, 4)\\n    .map((p) => ({\\n      ...p,\\n      pays_quota: p.estimated_annual_savings >= quotaAnnual,\\n    }));\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    totalSavings,\\n    annualQuotaCost: quotaAnnual,\\n    savingsMultiplier,\\n    partnersCount: activePartners.length,\\n    partnersPayingQuotaCount: partnersPayingQuota.length,\\n    breakdown: {\\n      couponSavings,\\n      voucherSavings,\\n      codeSavings,\\n    },\\n    topBenefits,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// ==========================================\\n// 6. ROTATING 6-DIGIT CODE & MERCHANT VALIDATION\\n// ==========================================\\n\\n// Issue or retrieve active redemption for an associate\\nrouter.post(\'/benefits/redeem\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(401).json({ error: \'Inicie sess\303\243o para aceder ao c\303\263digo de desconto.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!user.quota_status.has_active_quota) {\\n    return res.status(403).json({\\n      error: \'O acesso aos c\303\263digos \303\251 exclusivo para associados com quota ativa. Por favor renove a sua quota.\',\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  const { partner_id } = req.body;\\n  if (!partner_id) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'Parceiro n\303\243o especificado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const partner = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM partners WHERE id = ? AND is_active = 1\').get(partner_id) as any;\\n  if (!partner) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Parceiro n\303\243o encontrado ou inativo.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  // Check rate limit: 5 issuances per hour\\n  const rateLimit = checkIssuanceRateLimit(user.id);\\n  if (!rateLimit.allowed) {\\n    logAudit(user.id, \'limite_emissao_atingido\', `Tentativa de exceder 5 emiss\303\265es/hora`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return res.status(429).json({\\n      error: \'Atingiu o limite de seguran\303\247a de 5 emiss\303\265es por hora. Por favor aguarde um momento antes de gerar novo c\303\263digo.\',\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  // Check if there is already an active (unexpired, unused) redemption for this partner\\n  const nowIso = new Date().toISOString();\\n  const existing = db.prepare(`\\n    SELECT * FROM redemptions\\n    WHERE user_id = ? AND partner_id = ? AND status = \'active\' AND expires_at > ?\\n    ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 1\\n  `).get(user.id, partner_id, nowIso) as any;\\n\\n  let redemption = existing;\\n\\n  if (!redemption) {\\n    const secretSalt = crypto.randomBytes(32).toString(\'hex\');\\n    const refCode = `LPCS-${partner.name.substring(0, 3).toUpperCase()}-${Math.floor(100000 + Math.random() * 900000)}`;\\n    // 15 minutes validity\\n    const expiresAt = new Date(Date.now() + 15 * 60 * 1000).toISOString();\\n\\n    const insert = db.prepare(`\\n      INSERT INTO redemptions (partner_id, user_id, secret_salt, reference_code, expires_at)\\n      VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?)\\n    `).run(partner_id, user.id, secretSalt, refCode, expiresAt);\\n\\n    redemption = {\\n      id: Number(insert.lastInsertRowid),\\n      partner_id,\\n      user_id: user.id,\\n      secret_salt: secretSalt,\\n      reference_code: refCode,\\n      expires_at: expiresAt,\\n      status: \'active\',\\n    };\\n\\n    logAudit(\\n      user.id,\\n      \'emissao_codigo\',\\n      `Emitido c\303\263digo de desconto para ${partner.name} (Ref: ${refCode})`,\\n      req.ip,\\n      req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  const totp = generateTOTPCode(redemption.secret_salt);\\n\\n  logAudit(\\n    user.id,\\n    \'visualizacao_codigo\',\\n    `Visualiza\303\247\303\243o de c\303\263digo para ${partner.name} (Ref: ${redemption.reference_code})`,\\n    req.ip,\\n    req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n  );\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    redemption_id: redemption.id,\\n    reference_code: redemption.reference_code,\\n    totp_code: totp.code,\\n    seconds_remaining: totp.secondsRemaining,\\n    expires_at: redemption.expires_at,\\n    partner_name: partner.name,\\n    benefit_type: partner.benefit_type,\\n    discount_highlight: partner.discount_highlight,\\n    benefit_value: partner.benefit_value,\\n    secret_code: partner.secret_code,\\n    member_number: user.member_number,\\n    member_name: user.name,\\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Refresh 6-digit code for an active redemption\\nrouter.get(\'/benefits/code-refresh/:redemptionId\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(401).json({ error: \'N\303\243o autenticado\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const redemption = db.prepare(`\\n    SELECT * FROM redemptions WHERE id = ? AND user_id = ?\\n  `).get(req.params.redemptionId, user.id) as any;\\n\\n  if (!redemption) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Resgate n\303\243o encontrado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  if (redemption.status !== \'active\' || new Date(redemption.expires_at).getTime() < Date.now()) {\\n    return res.status(410).json({ error: \'Este c\303\263digo expirou ou j\303\241 foi utilizado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const totp = generateTOTPCode(redemption.secret_salt);\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    totp_code: totp.code,\\n    seconds_remaining: totp.secondsRemaining,\\n    reference_code: redemption.reference_code,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Merchant Validation Route (`/validar`)\\nrouter.post(\'/benefits/verify-code\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const { reference_code, code, merchant_name } = req.body;\\n\\n  if (!reference_code || !code) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'Por favor introduza a refer\303\252ncia do resgate e o c\303\263digo de 6 d\303\255gitos.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const cleanRef = reference_code.trim().toUpperCase();\\n  const cleanCode = code.trim();\\n\\n  const redemption = db.prepare(`\\n    SELECT r.*, p.name as partner_name, p.benefit_type, p.discount_highlight, p.benefit_value,\\n           u.name as member_name, u.member_number, u.nif as member_nif\\n    FROM redemptions r\\n    JOIN partners p ON p.id = r.partner_id\\n    JOIN users u ON u.id = r.user_id\\n    WHERE r.reference_code = ?\\n  `).get(cleanRef) as any;\\n\\n  if (!redemption) {\\n    logAudit(null, \'validacao_falha\', `Refer\303\252ncia n\303\243o encontrada: ${cleanRef}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Refer\303\252ncia de resgate n\303\243o encontrada no sistema.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  if (redemption.status === \'used\') {\\n    logAudit(redemption.user_id, \'validacao_falha\', `Tentativa de reutiliza\303\247\303\243o do c\303\263digo ${cleanRef} j\303\241 usado em ${redemption.used_at}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return res.status(400).json({\\n      error: `Este c\303\263digo j\303\241 foi utilizado em ${new Date(redemption.used_at).toLocaleString(\'pt-PT\')} e n\303\243o pode ser reutilizado.`,\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  if (new Date(redemption.expires_at).getTime() < Date.now()) {\\n    logAudit(redemption.user_id, \'validacao_falha\', `Tentativa de validar c\303\263digo expirado: ${cleanRef}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'A janela de validade deste resgate (15 minutos) expirou. Solicite ao associado que gere um novo c\303\263digo.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  // Verify HMAC TOTP code with clock drift tolerance\\n  const isValid = verifyTOTPCode(redemption.secret_salt, cleanCode);\\n  if (!isValid) {\\n    logAudit(redemption.user_id, \'validacao_falha\', `C\303\263digo de 6 d\303\255gitos inv\303\241lido (${cleanCode}) para ${cleanRef}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return res.status(400).json({\\n      error: \'C\303\263digo de 6 d\303\255gitos inv\303\241lido ou expirado. O c\303\263digo muda a cada 30 segundos. Verifique o ecr\303\243 do associado.\',\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  // Consume the code atomically!\\n  const now = new Date().toISOString();\\n  db.prepare(`\\n    UPDATE redemptions\\n    SET status = \'used\', used_at = ?, used_by_merchant = ?\\n    WHERE id = ?\\n  `).run(now, merchant_name || \'Comerciante Validado\', redemption.id);\\n\\n  logAudit(\\n    redemption.user_id,\\n    \'validacao_sucesso\',\\n    `Desconto validado com sucesso para ${redemption.partner_name} pelo comerciante (${merchant_name || \'Geral\'})`,\\n    req.ip,\\n    req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n  );\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    success: true,\\n    message: \'Desconto validado e consumido com sucesso!\',\\n    validated_at: now,\\n    partner_name: redemption.partner_name,\\n    discount_highlight: redemption.discount_highlight,\\n    benefit_value: redemption.benefit_value,\\n    member_name: redemption.member_name,\\n    member_number: redemption.member_number,\\n    reference_code: redemption.reference_code,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// ==========================================\\n// 7. BACKOFFICE ADMINISTRATION (`/admin`)\\n// Restricted to ADMIN_EMAIL and is_admin = true\\n// ==========================================\\n\\nfunction requireAdmin(req: Request, res: Response, next: () => void) {\\n  const user = getSessionUser(req);\\n  if (!user || !isUserAdmin(user)) {\\n    logAudit(user?.id || null, \'acesso_admin_negado\', `Tentativa de acesso n\303\243o autorizado a rota administrativa`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n    return res.status(403).json({ error: \'Acesso restrito ao administrador oficial da LPCS.\' });\\n  }\\n  next();\\n}\\n\\nrouter.get(\'/admin/summary\', requireAdmin, (_req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const usersCount = db.prepare(\'SELECT count(*) as count FROM users WHERE is_admin = 0\').get() as { count: number };\\n  const suspendedCount = db.prepare(\'SELECT count(*) as count FROM users WHERE is_suspended = 1\').get() as { count: number };\\n  const partnersActive = db.prepare(\'SELECT count(*) as count FROM partners WHERE is_active = 1\').get() as { count: number };\\n  const partnersInactive = db.prepare(\'SELECT count(*) as count FROM partners WHERE is_active = 0\').get() as { count: number };\\n  const totalRevenueCents = db.prepare(\\\"SELECT COALESCE(SUM(amount_cents), 0) as total FROM quotas WHERE status = \'pago\'\\\").get() as { total: number };\\n  const redemptionsUsed = db.prepare(\\\"SELECT count(*) as count FROM redemptions WHERE status = \'used\'\\\").get() as { count: number };\\n  const redemptionsTotal = db.prepare(\'SELECT count(*) as count FROM redemptions\').get() as { count: number };\\n\\n  // Count active quotas\\n  const today = new Date().toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n  const activeQuotasCount = db.prepare(`\\n    SELECT count(DISTINCT user_id) as count FROM quotas\\n    WHERE status = \'pago\' AND valid_until >= ?\\n  `).get(today) as { count: number };\\n\\n  const recentLogs = db.prepare(`\\n    SELECT a.*, u.name as user_name, u.member_number\\n    FROM audit_logs a\\n    LEFT JOIN users u ON u.id = a.user_id\\n    ORDER BY a.created_at DESC LIMIT 20\\n  `).all();\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    metrics: {\\n      totalAssociados: usersCount.count,\\n      associadosQuotaAtiva: activeQuotasCount.count,\\n      associadosInativos: usersCount.count - activeQuotasCount.count,\\n      associadosSuspensos: suspendedCount.count,\\n      parceirosAtivos: partnersActive.count,\\n      parceirosInativos: partnersInactive.count,\\n      receitaTotalEuros: totalRevenueCents.total / 100,\\n      descontosResgatados: redemptionsUsed.count,\\n      descontosEmitidosTotal: redemptionsTotal.count,\\n    },\\n    recentLogs,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.get(\'/admin/users\', requireAdmin, (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const { filter, search } = req.query;\\n\\n  let query = \'SELECT * FROM users WHERE 1=1\';\\n  const params: any[] = [];\\n\\n  if (search && typeof search === \'string\' && search.trim() !== \'\') {\\n    query += \' AND (name LIKE ? OR email LIKE ? OR member_number LIKE ? OR nif LIKE ?)\';\\n    const term = `%${search.trim()}%`;\\n    params.push(term, term, term, term);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (filter === \'suspensos\') {\\n    query += \' AND is_suspended = 1\';\\n  }\\n\\n  query += \' ORDER BY created_at DESC\';\\n\\n  const rows = db.prepare(query).all(...params) as any[];\\n\\n  // Augment with quota status\\n  const usersWithQuota = rows.map((u) => {\\n    const qStatus = getQuotaStatus(u.id);\\n    return {\\n      id: u.id,\\n      name: u.name,\\n      email: u.email,\\n      member_number: u.member_number,\\n      nif: u.nif,\\n      phone: u.phone,\\n      city: u.city,\\n      is_admin: u.is_admin,\\n      is_suspended: u.is_suspended,\\n      created_at: u.created_at,\\n      quota_status: qStatus,\\n    };\\n  });\\n\\n  let filtered = usersWithQuota;\\n  if (filter === \'ativos\') {\\n    filtered = usersWithQuota.filter((u) => u.quota_status.has_active_quota);\\n  } else if (filter === \'inativos\') {\\n    filtered = usersWithQuota.filter((u) => !u.quota_status.has_active_quota && !u.is_suspended);\\n  }\\n\\n  return res.json({ users: filtered });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.post(\'/admin/users/:id/suspend\', requireAdmin, (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const admin = getSessionUser(req)!;\\n  const targetId = Number(req.params.id);\\n\\n  if (targetId === admin.id) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'O administrador n\303\243o pode suspender a sua pr\303\263pria conta.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const user = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\').get(targetId) as any;\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Associado n\303\243o encontrado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const newStatus = user.is_suspended ? 0 : 1;\\n  db.prepare(\'UPDATE users SET is_suspended = ? WHERE id = ?\').run(newStatus, targetId);\\n\\n  // If suspending, destroy all their active sessions\\n  if (newStatus === 1) {\\n    db.prepare(\'DELETE FROM sessions WHERE user_id = ?\').run(targetId);\\n  }\\n\\n  logAudit(\\n    admin.id,\\n    newStatus === 1 ? \'admin_suspensao_socio\' : \'admin_reativacao_socio\',\\n    `Associado ${user.name} (${user.member_number}) ${newStatus === 1 ? \'suspenso\' : \'reativado\'}`,\\n    req.ip,\\n    req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n  );\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    success: true,\\n    message: newStatus === 1 ? \'Associado suspenso com sucesso.\' : \'Associado reativado com sucesso.\',\\n    is_suspended: newStatus,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.post(\'/admin/users/:id/quota\', requireAdmin, (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const admin = getSessionUser(req)!;\\n  const targetId = Number(req.params.id);\\n  const { plan_type, notes } = req.body;\\n\\n  const user = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\').get(targetId) as any;\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Associado n\303\243o encontrado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const monthsToAdd = plan_type === \'semestral\' ? 6 : 12;\\n  const amountCents = plan_type === \'semestral\' ? 1750 : 3500;\\n\\n  const currentStatus = getQuotaStatus(targetId);\\n  let startDate: Date;\\n  if (currentStatus.has_active_quota && currentStatus.valid_until) {\\n    startDate = new Date(currentStatus.valid_until + \'T00:00:00\');\\n  } else {\\n    startDate = new Date();\\n  }\\n\\n  const endDate = new Date(startDate);\\n  endDate.setMonth(endDate.getMonth() + monthsToAdd);\\n\\n  const validFromStr = startDate.toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n  const validUntilStr = endDate.toISOString().split(\'T\')[0];\\n  const ref = `MANUAL-ADMIN-${Date.now().toString().slice(-6)}`;\\n\\n  db.prepare(`\\n    INSERT INTO quotas (\\n      user_id, plan_type, amount_cents, payment_method, reference, status, valid_from, valid_until\\n    ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, \'manual\', ?, \'pago\', ?, ?)\\n  `).run(targetId, plan_type, amountCents, ref, validFromStr, validUntilStr);\\n\\n  logAudit(\\n    admin.id,\\n    \'admin_lancamento_quota\',\\n    `Quota ${plan_type} lan\303\247ada manualmente para ${user.name} (${user.member_number}) at\303\251 ${validUntilStr}. Nota: ${notes || \'Sem nota\'}`,\\n    req.ip,\\n    req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n  );\\n\\n  return res.json({\\n    success: true,\\n    message: `Quota atribu\303\255da com sucesso at\303\251 ${validUntilStr}.`,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.delete(\'/admin/users/:id\', requireAdmin, (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const admin = getSessionUser(req)!;\\n  const targetId = Number(req.params.id);\\n\\n  if (targetId === admin.id) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'O administrador n\303\243o se pode remover a si pr\303\263prio.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const user = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\').get(targetId) as any;\\n  if (!user) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Associado n\303\243o encontrado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  // Cascade delete sessions, quotas, receipts, redemptions\\n  db.prepare(\'DELETE FROM users WHERE id = ?\').run(targetId);\\n\\n  logAudit(\\n    admin.id,\\n    \'admin_remocao_socio\',\\n    `Conta do associado ${user.name} (${user.member_number}, ${user.email}) e dados associados eliminados`,\\n    req.ip,\\n    req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n  );\\n\\n  return res.json({ success: true, message: \'Associado e dados associados removidos com sucesso.\' });\\n});\\n\\n// Partner CRUD for Admin\\nrouter.post(\'/admin/partners\', requireAdmin, (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const admin = getSessionUser(req)!;\\n  const {\\n    name,\\n    category,\\n    description,\\n    area,\\n    district,\\n    city,\\n    benefit_type,\\n    benefit_value,\\n    discount_highlight,\\n    usage_limit,\\n    estimated_annual_savings,\\n    valid_until,\\n    terms,\\n    website,\\n    is_active,\\n    secret_code,\\n  } = req.body;\\n\\n  if (!name || !area || !benefit_type || !discount_highlight || !secret_code) {\\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: \'Preencha os campos obrigat\303\263rios do parceiro.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const result = db.prepare(`\\n    INSERT INTO partners (\\n      name, category, description, area, district, city, benefit_type,\\n      benefit_value, discount_highlight, usage_limit, estimated_annual_savings,\\n      valid_until, terms, website, is_active, secret_code\\n    ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)\\n  `).run(\\n    name.trim(),\\n    category || \'Geral\',\\n    description || \'\',\\n    area,\\n    district || \'Nacional\',\\n    city || \'Nacional\',\\n    benefit_type,\\n    benefit_value || discount_highlight,\\n    discount_highlight,\\n    usage_limit || \'Uso regular\',\\n    parseFloat(estimated_annual_savings) || 40.0,\\n    valid_until || \'2027-12-31\',\\n    terms || \'Condi\303\247\303\265es gerais LPCS\',\\n    website || \'\',\\n    is_active ? 1 : 0,\\n    secret_code.trim().toUpperCase()\\n  );\\n\\n  logAudit(admin.id, \'admin_criacao_parceiro\', `Novo parceiro criado: ${name}`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n\\n  return res.json({ success: true, partnerId: Number(result.lastInsertRowid) });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.put(\'/admin/partners/:id\', requireAdmin, (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const admin = getSessionUser(req)!;\\n  const partnerId = Number(req.params.id);\\n  const {\\n    name,\\n    category,\\n    description,\\n    area,\\n    district,\\n    city,\\n    benefit_type,\\n    benefit_value,\\n    discount_highlight,\\n    usage_limit,\\n    estimated_annual_savings,\\n    valid_until,\\n    terms,\\n    website,\\n    is_active,\\n    secret_code,\\n  } = req.body;\\n\\n  db.prepare(`\\n    UPDATE partners SET\\n      name = ?, category = ?, description = ?, area = ?, district = ?, city = ?,\\n      benefit_type = ?, benefit_value = ?, discount_highlight = ?, usage_limit = ?,\\n      estimated_annual_savings = ?, valid_until = ?, terms = ?, website = ?,\\n      is_active = ?, secret_code = ?\\n    WHERE id = ?\\n  `).run(\\n    name.trim(),\\n    category,\\n    description,\\n    area,\\n    district,\\n    city,\\n    benefit_type,\\n    benefit_value,\\n    discount_highlight,\\n    usage_limit,\\n    parseFloat(estimated_annual_savings) || 40.0,\\n    valid_until,\\n    terms,\\n    website,\\n    is_active ? 1 : 0,\\n    secret_code.trim().toUpperCase(),\\n    partnerId\\n  );\\n\\n  logAudit(admin.id, \'admin_edicao_parceiro\', `Parceiro editado: ${name} (ID: ${partnerId})`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n\\n  return res.json({ success: true, message: \'Parceiro atualizado com sucesso.\' });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.post(\'/admin/partners/:id/toggle\', requireAdmin, (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const admin = getSessionUser(req)!;\\n  const partnerId = Number(req.params.id);\\n\\n  const partner = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM partners WHERE id = ?\').get(partnerId) as any;\\n  if (!partner) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Parceiro n\303\243o encontrado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  const newStatus = partner.is_active ? 0 : 1;\\n  db.prepare(\'UPDATE partners SET is_active = ? WHERE id = ?\').run(newStatus, partnerId);\\n\\n  logAudit(\\n    admin.id,\\n    \'admin_toggle_parceiro\',\\n    `Parceiro ${partner.name} ${newStatus === 1 ? \'ativado\' : \'desativado\'}`,\\n    req.ip,\\n    req.headers[\'user-agent\']\\n  );\\n\\n  return res.json({ success: true, is_active: newStatus });\\n});\\n\\nrouter.delete(\'/admin/partners/:id\', requireAdmin, (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const admin = getSessionUser(req)!;\\n  const partnerId = Number(req.params.id);\\n\\n  const partner = db.prepare(\'SELECT * FROM partners WHERE id = ?\').get(partnerId) as any;\\n  if (!partner) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Parceiro n\303\243o encontrado.\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  db.prepare(\'DELETE FROM partners WHERE id = ?\').run(partnerId);\\n\\n  logAudit(admin.id, \'admin_remocao_parceiro\', `Parceiro ${partner.name} removido`, req.ip, req.headers[\'user-agent\']);\\n\\n  return res.json({ success: true, message: \'Parceiro removido com sucesso.\' });\\n});\\n\\nexport default router;\\n\", \"Description\":\"Complete Express API router with native form support, validation, quotas, receipts, partners masking, anti-abuse TOTP, and admin backoffice\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/server/api.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating API router\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create full API router with all required endpoints\"}"
