  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Footer Component**\n\nI\'m now focused on the `Footer.tsx` component. I\'m busy integrating all the required elements: contact information for LPCS, the legal mentions, including the NIPC and \"Utilidade P\303\272blica\" designation, and details about the national health line and solidarity causes. Links will also be embedded.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8664378906004103080"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Heart, Phone, Mail, MapPin, ExternalLink, ShieldCheck } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport const Footer: React.FC<{ onNavigate: (path: string) => void }> = ({ onNavigate }) => {\\n  return (\\n    <footer className=\\\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800 mt-20\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10\\\">\\n          \\n          {/* Column 1: Brand & Mission */}\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-4 md:col-span-1\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-xs\\\">\\n                <svg className=\\\"w-5 h-5 fill-white\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n                  <path d=\\\"M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z\\\"/>\\n                </svg>\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-extrabold text-white text-lg tracking-tight\\\">LPCS</span>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Desde 1990</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Institui\303\247\303\243o Particular de Solidariedade Social (IPSS) e Pessoa Coletiva de Utilidade P\303\272blica dedicada \303\240 preven\303\247\303\243o da infe\303\247\303\243o por VIH/SIDA, apoio \303\240s pessoas vivendo com a doen\303\247a e defesa dos direitos humanos.\\n            </p>\\n            <div className=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n              NIPC: 502 489 120\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Column 2: Navigation Links */}\\n          <div>\\n            <h4 className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\\\">Portal do Associado</h4>\\n            <ul className=\\\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <li>\\n                <button onClick={() => onNavigate(\'/\')} className=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n                  In\303\255cio & Benef\303\255cios\\n                </button>\\n              </li>\\n              <li>\\n                <button onClick={() => onNavigate(\'/parceiros\')} className=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n                  Cat\303\241logo de Parceiros (28 parceiros)\\n                </button>\\n              </li>\\n              <li>\\n                <button onClick={() => onNavigate(\'/dashboard\')} className=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n                  \303\201rea Pessoal do S\303\263cio\\n                </button>\\n              </li>\\n              <li>\\n                <button onClick={() => onNavigate(\'/pagamentos\')} className=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n                  Pagamento de Quotas & Recibos\\n                </button>\\n              </li>\\n              <li>\\n                <button onClick={() => onNavigate(\'/validar\')} className=\\\"hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n                  Validador de Descontos (Comerciantes)\\n                </button>\\n              </li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Column 3: Contact & Support */}\\n          <div>\\n            <h4 className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\\\">Contactos & Linha SOS</h4>\\n            <ul className=\\\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <li className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n                <MapPin className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-red-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Rua de Santa Maria Maior, 42, 1100-001 Lisboa</span>\\n              </li>\\n              <li className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <Phone className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-red-500 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <span>Linha SOS SIDA: 800 20 10 40 (Gr\303\241tis)</span>\\n              </li>\\n              <li className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <Mail className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-red-500 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <span>associados@lpcs.pt</span>\\n              </li>\\n              <li className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <span>DPO & Prote\303\247\303\243o de Dados RGPD</span>\\n              </li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Column 4: Solidarity Message */}\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-slate-800/60 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/60 flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-red-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\\\">\\n                <Heart className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-red-400\\\" />\\n                <span>Compromisso Solid\303\241rio</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                Ao manter a sua quota de 35,00\342\202\254/ano em dia, apoia diretamente os centros de apoio psicossocial, testes r\303\241pidos an\303\263nimos e gratuitos, e a\303\247\303\265es educativas nas escolas.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-700/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <span>Menos de 2,92\342\202\254/m\303\252s</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-white\\\">Impacto Real</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Bottom Bar */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n          <p>\302\251 {new Date().getFullYear()} Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Seguran\303\247a HMAC-SHA256 & scrypt</span>\\n            <span>\342\200\242</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Portugal</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Footer component with institutional details, helpline, contacts, and legal info\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Footer.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Footer component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Footer component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\365\002\n\362\002\001i\024}\023\266\360\307\255e\035_?\037H!b\313\034\033\222\376\232o\354\333\031\223\347\001\374\267\274#\177m\177]\032|qP(\330\243\030:\034\3157\223\224\273\204Z\354\253\221\266)\217\223\034$\220\336\030\\\201\262\376\367\225\037D\0207\t\373\356\362TE\005\212\004\211\023\325\353\2439\222E/\206\030\311\177w\304\372\220m9\316A_}\336\211\335\233\001Q\342\240\234\277m7E#z\373:\336\347\324>\006q\354~$\321\311\367W\240\217\v8>Pb\022i\034\342Nd\276\366e\256mx\203\246\246  ],4\340\021\274\nHuW\273#\270\231\v\024M\3370\302.u\242\305p\365E\0319\3453\034,\263JL\326=\277\351c\320\326\177\275\343\232l\233H\223sd\222u4\'F\357\276\222W\336\351\024c\334\332)\342\254\237\n0.\303\005\274\353\317s\303V\341K\323Y\237\312\026\t\324\270\031\016\315=\020f\273\267D\a\354\204\320\227\260B\225\232\350\335,p\345T\317\362>\000_z\232\352b)\357\\x\275s\335\366~\312\236tI\274[\277@\325\034B\266\202\231\344\334@\204X\364R\347\372\253\351C\277\243\244Z2\323+O\312\tJ+u\033\252\017\374a\217x\206\242\201\001\242\260\016p\335\021Q!\315\r\325\030\037\205[$\245|\247\241\252\365"
