    thinking: "**Developing Database and API**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the backend. I\'m updating `src/server/db.ts` to include the `partner_inquiries` table, and I will be adding API endpoints to `src/server/api.ts`. These endpoints will handle both corporate partnership inquiry submissions via `POST /api/partners/inquiry` and management within admin via `GET /api/admin/inquiry`.\n\n\n"
