  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining CodeModal Logic**\n\nI\'m currently focused on cleaning up the `CodeModal.tsx` component. The goal is to trigger `onClose()` more reliably using `useEffect` when `autoCloseRemaining` hits zero. I\'m also ensuring the data fetching is initiated only after `secondsRemaining` gets to zero, keeping things tightly synchronized. I\'m hoping to avoid the nested `setState` calls by triggering parent state updates only from the child using `useEffect`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4193265401801929002"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Avoid side effects (fetch and onClose) inside React state updaters in CodeModal.tsx\", \"EndLine\":63, \"Instruction\":\"Move refresh fetch and autoClose onClose trigger out of setState updaters into clean effects\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [currentCode, setCurrentCode] = useState(redemptionData.totp_code);\\n  const [secondsRemaining, setSecondsRemaining] = useState(redemptionData.seconds_remaining);\\n  const [isWindowBlurred, setIsWindowBlurred] = useState(false);\\n  const [copied, setCopied] = useState(false);\\n  const [autoCloseRemaining, setAutoCloseRemaining] = useState(180); // 3 minutes availability\\n\\n  // Tick down both the 30s TOTP window and the 3-minute modal countdown\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const timer = setInterval(() => {\\n      setSecondsRemaining((prev) => (prev <= 1 ? 0 : prev - 1));\\n      setAutoCloseRemaining((prev) => (prev <= 1 ? 0 : prev - 1));\\n    }, 1000);\\n\\n    return () => clearInterval(timer);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Refresh the rotating 6-digit code whenever the 30s window reaches 0\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (secondsRemaining > 0) return;\\n\\n    let cancelled = false;\\n    fetch(`/api/benefits/code-refresh/${redemptionData.redemption_id}`, {\\n      credentials: \'same-origin\',\\n    })\\n      .then((r) => r.json())\\n      .then((data) => {\\n        if (cancelled) return;\\n        if (data.totp_code) {\\n          setCurrentCode(data.totp_code);\\n          setSecondsRemaining(data.seconds_remaining || 30);\\n        } else {\\n          setSecondsRemaining(30);\\n        }\\n      })\\n      .catch((err) => {\\n        console.error(\'Error refreshing code:\', err);\\n        if (!cancelled) setSecondsRemaining(30);\\n      });\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      cancelled = true;\\n    };\\n  }, [secondsRemaining, redemptionData.redemption_id]);\\n\\n  // Auto-close modal once the 3-minute availability window expires\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (autoCloseRemaining <= 0) {\\n      onClose();\\n    }\\n  }, [autoCloseRemaining, onClose]);\", \"StartLine\":24, \"TargetContent\":\"  const [currentCode, setCurrentCode] = useState(redemptionData.totp_code);\\n  const [secondsRemaining, setSecondsRemaining] = useState(redemptionData.seconds_remaining);\\n  const [isWindowBlurred, setIsWindowBlurred] = useState(false);\\n  const [copied, setCopied] = useState(false);\\n  const [autoCloseRemaining, setAutoCloseRemaining] = useState(180); // 3 minutes availability\\n\\n  // Fetch code update every second / when seconds reach 0\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const timer = setInterval(() => {\\n      setSecondsRemaining((prev) => {\\n        if (prev <= 1) {\\n          // Refresh code from server\\n          fetch(`/api/benefits/code-refresh/${redemptionData.redemption_id}`, {\\n            credentials: \'same-origin\',\\n          })\\n            .then((r) => r.json())\\n            .then((data) => {\\n              if (data.totp_code) {\\n                setCurrentCode(data.totp_code);\\n                setSecondsRemaining(data.seconds_remaining || 30);\\n              }\\n            })\\n            .catch((err) => console.error(\'Error refreshing code:\', err));\\n          return 30;\\n        }\\n        return prev - 1;\\n      });\\n\\n      setAutoCloseRemaining((prev) => {\\n        if (prev <= 1) {\\n          onClose();\\n          return 0;\\n        }\\n        return prev - 1;\\n      });\\n    }, 1000);\\n\\n    return () => clearInterval(timer);\\n  }, [redemptionData.redemption_id, onClose]);\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/CodeModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating CodeModal timer effects\", \"toolSummary\":\"Refactor CodeModal timer effects\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\215\006\n\212\006\001i\024}\023\344\233\236*\244\205.\363pvW\252Zg\351\001\324\333\243@M\214f\341dw\241\244\336\255\325R\034\203\2043\002j\376z\177d\200Sr\242\333\311;2)/N\'\032H0\253\000\r.\351\277`-\301\301\231\245\273\332\202\003\237j\270)\314[\317D\036\017\3108\203U09}\205\005\343j\267\352\202_\001\216\336\030\t\"\3501V]\230\025!\217\345\302?\376\356\205\202\362SFl\272j>Vw\356I\263\370\340i+\262\352m3d\371\267\217*\230\351\244c_\030RE\355\273\330\220w\355\231\370\262\252R2^%\370\376\242B\356\373\207\343\r)6R+\375\335\"d\276\267\020C\3662\006E\025r9Q\330\036\2132\204\322\304\246\251\373{>{G\377\272\352\324&\337b\245\243AMP\211\t\212Xs\270J\340\'\027[\263\271\326fP\330\254\3657\224\215\230\005I\246Wv\324\274w?\325\377\254a\370\003\030\245\366\231\215\317h\214\333#@\020#\343\326\377Ia\334t\303\243\231\246\005e\205\212+AO\332aK[\256[.\353\303A0\270\n\374\353\312=\374\203!\2248WzJ\022\365\224\317\023\330\355\274m\a\031\346)\305\273\323_oY\202\324\034Q\017\206\250\365\350\256\201-\016g\323Cz\330\367\213\b\204\021&q>\035\254\375\374;\337\016\235m\244%\320\237=FS\363Kx\235\252[\350\264\027\344\220!\237\030\260Xz\241\\\'l\246\020\246-dxp\2349\317?\335I~\262m\177=\020\322\253?\240\342O\t6\357P8\204\326\344\034nT\374;@\345\365\001qW\026\321`\237oY\262P\272<\257\351g\v\365\027K\276x\035\357\260\265\026\031\255\342[\025\036\032$\335\370\377Ng\353L\002\276C\027k\3049}<\323\2645I\355\255!\301\377K\326Q\f\251\3210\270R\016\257\223\274\347\"4\344\246\277m\036\325\373\341\262\367\332\201dU\b\201\222\256\212\372\033dB\373d\320\347B\372!TM\256\361\226\364\350\211\234\323~q\3749\231\300\235\t\203\357F\233w\241\273\343\"\257\003\v\2161\243\256\277\304\246\"y;\244\311\350\364\373\344\324\277_\207\275\204\206\016+\337Y7\301\275\017\203\274\244$,\017[z\267\375\300\230\2526\223t\214Ez\342\203\001\333\366\315!%[S\312\345Q\371\020\365\037K\210\341\212\237u\\\375\254\214\261\\\212s\274\020\001\025\'&\377\376\212\371\272t\264k\022\212\340\345\255\3311\225\037|