  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the New Aesthetic**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a unified aesthetic across the entire application. The goal is a portal transformation that blends editorial-institutional elements with precision, all while adhering to the frontend design principles and drawing upon relevant domain references, such as the museum example provided.\n\n\n**Defining the Visual Upgrades**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the architectural and visual upgrades. The focus is on a contemporary Portuguese civic aesthetic. I\'ve chosen a crisp, off-white neutral canvas, deep ink charcoal for contrast, subtle hairline stone borders, and the LPCS crimson as the high-intent accent. The typography will adhere to a 2+1 font rule, with Fraunces for display, Plus Jakarta Sans for UI elements, and JetBrains Mono for specific numerical data to ensure readability.\n\n\n**Implementing Font Integration**\n\nI\'ve integrated the fonts (`Fraunces`, `Plus Jakarta Sans`, `JetBrains Mono`) into the project\'s `index.html` and configured the necessary theme utilities in `src/index.css`. I\'m also implementing \"Anti-Slop & Restraint Rules\" to elevate the visual integrity. These include replacing pill badges with clean typographic kickers, removing decorative pulsing dots, and eliminating thick left accent borders. I am designing the Top Bar with a single-line brand wordmark.\n\n\n**Refining Navigation & Depth**\n\nI\'m now refining the navigation links, aiming for concise single-line entries with subtle underlines. I\'m also ensuring a consistent single-row top bar design with a primary action button, keeping the height concise for mobile. I\'m moving away from heavy shadows and nested boxes, embracing flat surfaces and clean dividers for a more modern aesthetic. Additionally, I\'m enforcing tabular numerals across numerical data for improved readability.\n\n\n**Elevating Visual Storytelling**\n\nI\'m developing the visual narrative through photography now. I\'ve specified three key images to enhance the portal\'s aesthetic: a community health center hero shot, a partnership handshake in front of a modern clinic, and a wellness scene. All will be captured with warm tones and editorial grade in a documentary style to exude understated elegance.\n\n\n"
