    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nContinuing maintenance and visual refinement of the **Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA (LPCS)** Associates Portal (`Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + Express + SQLite`), all in **Portuguese (Portugal)**:\n- **Previous Completed Tasks:**\n  1. Increased the rotating 6-digit TOTP code modal (`CodeModal.tsx`) availability from 2 minutes (`120s`) to **3 minutes (`180s`)**, keeping 30-second HMAC-SHA256 rotation via `/api/benefits/code-refresh/:redemptionId` (`credentials: \'same-origin\'`) inside the 15-minute server redemption window; verified build, lint, server restart, and live API checks.\n  2. Completed full visual redesign across all pages following `frontend-design` SKILL.md + `references/9_museum_editorial_institutional.md` + `references/3_saas_dashboard.md`, including generating 3 editorial assets (`src/assets/images/...`), clean 3-zone header, archival paper surfaces, tabular numerals, and zero-pill metadata.\n- **Current In-Progress User Request:**\n  1. *\"usa como tipo de letra Helvetica e as suas varia\303\247\303\265es (conforme apropriado)\"* \342\200\224 Switch typography across the entire app to **Helvetica** and its weight/style variations (Light 300, Regular 400, Medium/Semibold 500\342\200\223600, Bold 700, Condensed/tight tracking).\n  2. *\"usa o logo da Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA que segue em anexo\"* \342\200\224 Use the user\'s attached official logo at `/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg` (stored in workspace at `/public/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg`).\n  3. *\"coloca dados de identifica\303\247\303\243o da liga portuguesa contra a sida\"* \342\200\224 Display real, official institutional identification details of the Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA across the portal (and generated quota receipts).\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Inspected & Researched\n- Read `/public/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg` via `view_file`: confirmed it is a crisp horizontal landscape logo on `#FFFFFF` background featuring \"LIGA PORTUGUESA CONTRA A SIDA\" on the left and \"S I D A\" with the signature red bar (`#E31E24`) on the right.\n- Read `/server.ts`: confirmed Express serves `/api` and Vite serves `/public` assets at `/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg`.\n- Verified real official LPCS identification via `search_web`:\n  - **Denomina\303\247\303\243o:** Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA (LPCS)\n  - **Estatuto:** Institui\303\247\303\243o Particular de Solidariedade Social (IPSS) \302\267 Pessoa Coletiva de Utilidade P\303\272blica (desde 1990)\n  - **NIPC / NIF:** `502 665 548` *(replaced placeholder `502 489 120`)*\n  - **Sede:** Pra\303\247a Carlos Fabi\303\243o, n.\302\272 3, A/B, 1600-316 Lisboa *(replaced placeholder `Rua de Santa Maria Maior, 42`)*\n  - **Telefone:** `213 479 376`\n  - **E-mail:** `info@ligacontrasida.org` *(replaced placeholder `associados@lpcs.pt`)*\n  - **Website:** `www.ligacontrasida.org`\n- Read `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`, `references/9_museum_editorial_institutional.md`, and `references/3_saas_dashboard.md`.\n- Checked target lines in `/src/server/api.ts` (lines 350\342\200\223390), `/src/pages/HomePage.tsx` (lines 175\342\200\223255, 700\342\200\223785, 850\342\200\223904), `/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx` (lines 105\342\200\223175), and `/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx` (lines 65\342\200\22395).\n\n### Completed Edits (Not Yet Compiled/Verified After Final Batch)\n- `/index.html`: Removed Fraunces/Plus Jakarta Sans Google Fonts links and set favicon `<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/jpeg\" href=\"/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg\" />`.\n- `/src/index.css`: Switched `--font-sans` and `--font-display` to `\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"Nimbus Sans\", Arial, sans-serif`, `--font-mono` to `\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace`, added `.font-helvetica-light` (`font-weight: 300`) and `.font-helvetica-condensed` utilities.\n- `/src/components/Header.tsx`: Set header surface to `bg-white/95`, replaced the custom red heart SVG wordmark with the official `<img src=\"/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg\" alt=\"Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA\" className=\"h-12 sm:h-14 w-auto object-contain\" />`, updated primary button accent to `#E31E24`, kept 3-zone Top Bar Contract.\n- `/src/components/Footer.tsx`: Embedded the official LPCS logo inside a clean white plate (`bg-white rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2`) and replaced all placeholder LPCS details with verified official details (`NIPC 502 665 548`, `Pra\303\247a Carlos Fabi\303\243o, n.\302\272 3, A/B, 1600-316 Lisboa`, `Tel.: 213 479 376`, `info@ligacontrasida.org`, `www.ligacontrasida.org`, IPSS \302\267 Utilidade P\303\272blica).\n\n### Remaining Edits (In Progress / Not Yet Started)\n1. `/src/pages/HomePage.tsx`:\n   - Add an **Identifica\303\247\303\243o Institucional da Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA** section/card (above footer or below quota comparison/hero) showing the official logo, legal name (`Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA`), IPSS / Utilidade P\303\272blica status, `NIPC 502 665 548`, `Pra\303\247a Carlos Fabi\303\243o, n.\302\272 3, A/B, 1600-316 Lisboa`, `Tel. 213 479 376`, `info@ligacontrasida.org`, `www.ligacontrasida.org`.\n   - Refine headline/subhead classes in `HomePage.tsx` to leverage Helvetica variations (`font-bold tracking-[-0.025em]` for titles, `font-helvetica-light` for lead descriptions).\n2. `/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx`:\n   - Replace the red heart SVG icon (lines 79\342\200\22383) with the official LPCS logo (`/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg`) inside a crisp white container (`bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 inline-block mx-auto`).\n3. `/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx`:\n   - Replace the red heart SVG inside the digital member card (lines 152\342\200\223157) with the official LPCS logo on a clean white emblem container, and optionally show `Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA \302\267 NIPC 502 665 548` cleanly in the card/greeting.\n4. `/src/server/api.ts`:\n   - Update lines 359\342\200\223363 so automatically generated digital quota receipts use official LPCS data (`NIPC: 502 665 548`, `Sede: Pra\303\247a Carlos Fabi\303\243o, n.\302\272 3, A/B, 1600-316 Lisboa`, `Tel.: 213 479 376 \302\267 info@ligacontrasida.org`).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Logo Integration:** `/public/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg` has a solid `#FFFFFF` background. Displaying it directly on `#FFFFFF` surfaces (like `Header` and white card frames) or inside a crisp white badge container (`bg-white rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2`) on dark surfaces (`#141619` footer and member card) blends seamlessly with zero jagged edges.\n- **Official Identification Consistency:** Note that `src/server/db.ts:167` uses `\'Rua de Santa Maria Maior, 42\'` as a demo member\'s personal street address (`demo@lpcs.pt`), which is fine as sample member data\342\200\224do NOT confuse that with LPCS\'s headquarters (`Pra\303\247a Carlos Fabi\303\243o, n.\302\272 3, A/B, 1600-316 Lisboa`). Only `Footer.tsx`, `HomePage.tsx`, and `src/server/api.ts:362` held LPCS\'s institutional identity.\n- **Image Assets Already Generated & Active:**\n  - `/src/assets/images/hero_lpcs_community_1794510456196.jpg`\n  - `/src/assets/images/partnership_corporate_alliance_1794510456114.jpg`\n  - `/src/assets/images/member_wellness_benefit_1794510457676.jpg`\n  Do NOT invoke `generate_image` again; user explicitly stated only invoke image generation if explicitly requested.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- No compile or lint errors occurred in this turn; however, `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, and `restart_dev_server` have NOT yet been run since modifying `index.html`, `src/index.css`, `Header.tsx`, and `Footer.tsx`.\n- Remember from earlier turns: never use `process.env.*` in client-side `.tsx` files (fixed previously in `AdminPage.tsx`).\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace root: `/app/applet` (use `/` prefix for file tools).\n- Dev server runs `tsx server.ts` on port 3000 (`0.0.0.0:3000`).\n- All routes and pages currently exist: `HomePage.tsx`, `PartnersPage.tsx`, `PartnershipPage.tsx`, `DashboardPage.tsx`, `PaymentsPage.tsx`, `ProfilePage.tsx`, `LoginPage.tsx`, `RegisterPage.tsx`, `MerchantValidatePage.tsx`, `AdminPage.tsx`.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. Update `/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx` (lines 77\342\200\22390): replace heart SVG with official LPCS logo `/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg` in a clean white plate.\n2. Update `/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx` (lines 152\342\200\223166): replace heart SVG inside member card with official LPCS logo on a crisp white plate + include `NIPC 502 665 548` subtly on the card.\n3. Update `/src/pages/HomePage.tsx`:\n   - Refine typography classes to highlight Helvetica variations (`font-bold tracking-[-0.025em]` on display titles, `font-helvetica-light` on lead paragraphs).\n   - Add a clean **Identifica\303\247\303\243o Institucional da LPCS** section (before the closing or after quota plans) displaying the official logo, full name (`Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA`), legal status (`Institui\303\247\303\243o Particular de Solidariedade Social \302\267 Pessoa Coletiva de Utilidade P\303\272blica`), `NIPC 502 665 548`, Sede (`Pra\303\247a Carlos Fabi\303\243o, n.\302\272 3, A/B, 1600-316 Lisboa`), Telefone (`213 479 376`), E-mail (`info@ligacontrasida.org`), and Website (`www.ligacontrasida.org`).\n4. Update `/src/server/api.ts` (lines 358\342\200\223366): replace `NIPC: 502 489 120` with `NIPC: 502 665 548` and add the official LPCS headquarters address (`Pra\303\247a Carlos Fabi\303\243o, n.\302\272 3, A/B, 1600-316 Lisboa \302\267 Tel.: 213 479 376`).\n5. Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to verify zero TypeScript/Vite build errors.\n6. Call `restart_dev_server` so the running server reflects all updates, and run a quick `curl` check confirming HTTP 200 on `/`, `/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg`, and `/api/partners/hero-stats`.\n7. Provide a concise Portuguese (Portugal) summary confirming Helvetica typography variations, integration of the official LPCS logo, and inclusion of the official identification details of the Liga Portuguesa Contra a SIDA.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Language:** Entire UI and final response must be in **Portuguese (Portugal)**.\n- **Font:** Use **Helvetica** and its variations as explicitly requested by the user (do not revert to Fraunces/Plus Jakarta Sans).\n- **Asset Reference:** Reference `/assets/aistudio/logo_LPCS_f0a028f9.jpg` directly; do NOT call `generate_image`.\n- **Verification:** Always co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together on the final build check, restart dev server, and only claim observed results.\n- **No Internals:** Never expose internal file paths or step/tool internals in user-facing summaries.\n</summary>"
